From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mark Chiou <chiouss@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 08:44:28 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] zyxel-bootconfig-ipq: add ipq40xx support

Zyxel ipq40xx devices use the same dual-image "0:bootconfig"/
"0:bootconfig1" mechanism as the ipq807x based NWA110AX/NWA210AX.
Broaden the package DEPENDS to cover ipq40xx ahead of adding ipq40xx
devices that need it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: Mark Chiou <chiouss@gmail.com>
---
 package/utils/zyxel-bootconfig-ipq/Makefile | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/package/utils/zyxel-bootconfig-ipq/Makefile b/package/utils/zyxel-bootconfig-ipq/Makefile
index f7675b2793..7dd64de862 100644
--- a/package/utils/zyxel-bootconfig-ipq/Makefile
+++ b/package/utils/zyxel-bootconfig-ipq/Makefile
@@ -19,7 +19,7 @@ define Package/zyxel-bootconfig-ipq
 	CATEGORY:=Base system
 	TITLE:=Utility for handling Zyxel bootconfig settings on Qualcomm IPQ devices
 	MAINTAINER:=Pascal Beleiu <pascal@beleiu.de>
-	DEPENDS:=@TARGET_qualcommax_ipq807x
+	DEPENDS:=@(TARGET_qualcommax_ipq807x||TARGET_ipq40xx)
 endef
 
 define Package/zyxel-bootconfig-ipq/description
